      "side": 1,
      "message": "This code is all at VM init before the guest has started up. I think all of crosvm\u0027s guest memory layout code is essentially immutable after init right now. I assume pKVM sharing restricted memory is going to be at run time, right? We\u0027ll probably need a bigger refactoring to support it",
